    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d573">

                <pb facs="0990" n="856" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg856"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Italy)/6–2745: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 573<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy
                    </hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caserta</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-27T00:00:00+02:00">June 27,
                            1945—midnight</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2794. …</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <p>When we asked SAC his view as to Yugo reservation
                    on art 3 of Belg[rade] Agreement he expressed concurrence with our view that on
                    this point [we] must stand. He then commented: “Please do not worry about civil
                        admin in our area. As you know the Bel
                    Agreement gives me final author in the matter and I shall see to it that the
                    interpretation is such as to represent our views”.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
